# Minimal torrc for Zero Flare
# Run inside the tor container (docker-compose mounts this)

SocksPort 9150
ControlPort 9040
Log notice stdout
DataDirectory /data
ControlledAccessCoinValidation 0
PublishServerDescriptor 0
PublishClientDescriptor 0

# Enable Snowflake bridge automatically if available
# (Snowflake container provides the bridge, not this torrc)

# Do not act as a relay
ExitRelay 0
BridgeRelay 0
